  "body": "875 Hibiscus Coast Highway, Hatfields Beach\r\n\r\n\r\nLand like this, minutes from the beach, is a rare combination. \r\n\r\nSet on 1.247 hectares (approx.), this beautifully appointed cedar-clad home offers room to spread out and country living with Orewa's cafés and shops close by - without any of the work. \r\n\r\nYour own mature native bush, and the farmland beyond, delivers privacy and peace while your family and pets enjoy the generous grounds and a large flat lawn.\r\n\r\nThis is convenient luxury lifestyle without giving up life on the coast.\r\n\r\nThis spacious and beautifully presented home is ready to move straight into, with double glazing, four-zone ducted heating and cooling, and beautiful new curtains and blinds throughout.\r\n\r\nStep through the atrium entry to sunlit living that moves with you. A home theatre, gracious formal lounge, and an expansive open plan kitchen, dining and family area open to substantial covered outdoor decking. Slide the kitchen window open and pass the platters straight out to your guests - effortless summer entertaining at its best. \r\n\r\nFive bedrooms, with the master suite tucked privately away with garden access and your own deck, a spacious walk-in dressing room and ensuite.\r\n\r\nRoom for the boat, the motorhome and the trailer, with internal garaging, a full workshop and plenty of storage.\r\n\r\nA substantial coastal landholding, a country backdrop and a beautifully finished home. Why choose between country and coast when you can enjoy the feeling of both?\r\n\r\nWith significant infrastructure upgrades in the area, astute buyers will recognise the opportunity to secure this rare combination of land, luxury and coastal lifestyle.\r\n\r\nDon't miss this rare opportunity. Give us a call.\r\n\r\nDebs Wallace and Jacqui Cantell, \r\nPremium Real Estate\r\n\r\nSet Date of Sale 3rd December 2026 at 4pm (USP)",
